+// Tark: shows (or updates) the translate bar under the toolbar for
+// `web_contents`, in place of Chromium's translate bubble. Tark translates
+// pages on the computer; the bar has the languages, Original | Translated,
+// the preferences and ✕ (mockup A of the page translation design).
+void ShowTranslateBar(content::WebContents* web_contents,
+                      translate::TranslateStep step,
+                      const std::string& source_language,
+                      const std::string& target_language,
+                      translate::TranslateErrors error_type);
